    <div class="hero-copy" id="top">
      <div class="hero-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">For Linux and Windows</p>
        <h1 class="h1">Every game<br> you own.<br> <em>One launcher.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Steam, Epic, GOG, Amazon, emulators and more, in one fast native app.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" id="dl-main" href="#download">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v11m0 0-4.5-4.5M12 15l4.5-4.5M5 20h14"/></svg>
            <span id="dl-label">Download</span></a>
          <a class="link" href="https://github.com/RafaelGoulartB/Heronite">Source on GitHub &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="facts">
          <li>Free and open source</li>
          <li>No account</li>
          <li>No ads</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="motion" id="motion" type="button" aria-controls="wall" aria-pressed="false">Pause motion</button>
  </header>

  <main id="main">

  <!-- ============ SOURCES + ANNOTATED COLLECTION ============ -->
  <section class="scene sc-col" id="collection" aria-labelledby="h-col">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sources glass" role="region" aria-labelledby="h-src">
        <div>
          <h2 id="h-src" class="eyebrow">Plays games from</h2>
          <ul class="src-list">
            <li>Steam</li><li>Epic Games</li><li>GOG</li><li>Amazon Games</li><li>Battle.net<sup>*</sup></li><li>EA app<sup>*</sup></li><li>Ubisoft Connect<sup>*</sup></li><li>Rockstar Games<sup>*</sup></li><li>Emulators</li><li>Native Linux and Windows games</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="fine"><span aria-hidden="true">*</span> On Linux through Wine. On Linux it also imports Heroic, Lutris, Bottles and Faugus.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="src-side">
          <p>Log in to Epic, GOG and Amazon. Steam needs no login.</p>
          <p>One download queue installs, updates, repairs and moves.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Collection</p>
          <h2 class="h2" id="h-col">One shelf for <em>everything.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">Your stores, emulators and loose games, sorted the way you like.</p>
      </div>

      <figure class="anno">
        <div class="pins">
          <div class="frame">
            <img src="/screenshots/collection.webp" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy"
                 alt="Heronite's Collection: game covers grouped into Playing and On Going, with play time under each, and ELDEN RING open with its cover, Play button, score, Linux rating and a timeline of play sessions.">
          </div>
          <div class="callout to-right" style="--x:5.95%;--y:5.3%;--len:18px" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dot">1</span><span class="tip">Group by status</span></div>
          <div class="callout to-right" style="--x:5.75%;--y:46.9%;--len:22px" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dot">2</span><span class="tip">Play time per game</span></div>
          <div class="callout to-down" style="--x:34.1%;--y:81.6%;--len:22px;--tx:-3.3cqw" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dot">3</span><span class="tip">Linux rating and anti-cheat</span></div>
          <div class="callout to-right" style="--x:45.5%;--y:60.8%;--len:10px" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dot">4</span><span class="tip">Your timeline</span></div>
          <div class="callout to-down-end" style="--x:91.2%;--y:4.9%;--len:24px" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dot">5</span><span class="tip">List or grid of covers</span></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="sr-only">The Collection screen in Heronite, with five highlighted parts.</figcaption>
        <ol class="legend glass" aria-label="What the numbers point at">
          <li>Group by status</li>
          <li>Play time per game</li>
          <li>Linux rating and anti-cheat</li>
          <li>Your timeline</li>
          <li>List or grid of covers</li>
        </ol>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ BENTO OF DETAILS ============ -->
  <section class="scene sc-inside" id="inside" aria-labelledby="h-inside">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Inside the app</p>
          <h2 class="h2" id="h-inside">Real screens, <em>up close.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">Every tile is cropped from an actual Heronite screenshot.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bento">
